A TEST-ONLY change to the desktop app, never to be committed: a command-file driver (TestDriver.kt, reading
<user.home>/driver/cmd and logging every sync state to <user.home>/driver/state.log) and a hook that writes the
Dropbox consent URL to <user.home>/driver/authurl instead of opening the default browser (while
<user.home>/driver/nobrowser exists). Apply with `git apply documentation/testing/tools/desktop-test-driver.patch`,
revert with `git apply -R` on the same file. If it no longer applies, recreate it from this description.

